t kind of makes sense they're  here because the whole refinery is  basically a giant dam  mando and mayfield are treated like  heroes as they arrive at the base  it just goes to show that what's  considered a hero is determined by what  side you're on  in the base they find the terminal which  is conveniently located in the mess hall  for some reason but mayfield says he  can't go in there because his former  superior a man by the name of valen  hesse  would recognize him it's no coincidence  that his last name  hess is named after one of nazi  germany's biggest war criminals  rudolph hess both these men were  responsible for countless atrocities  this new development requires mando  himself to take off his helmet and  complete the facial scan to upload moff  gideon's coordinates to his data stick  something he's able to do but attracts  the attention of  hess mayfield comes to the rescue with  the genius excuse that the reason  mando didn't respond to hess was his  hearing went after his transport ship  lost  pressure on tanab in the original  storyline for the movie solo  tanem was supposed to be featured and  depicted as a jungle planet but that  didn't pan out  hess sits them down for a celebratory  drink as their vessel was the only one  that day to make it back in one piece  meanwhile cara and fenik scope out the  exterior guards to prepare for boba  fett's arrival the friendly drink  doesn't go nearly to plan as mayfield  inquires about hess's command of  operation  cinder on vernon khan an operation he  was a part of which saw  ten thousand men sacrifice for the quote  good of the empire  it took place weeks following the battle  of endor a plan put in place by  palpatine himself valance is by creating  havoc people will flock to the empire  once again  everybody thinks they want freedom  but what they really want is order  perhaps this is a nod to the first order  and its eventual ascension to power  mayfield is so infuriated by hess he  shoots him and he and mendo fight for  their lives shooting their way out of  yet  another sticky situation with cara and  fenec taking care of the guards outside  boba is clear to rescue the two men  safely getting them out with the  coordinates from off gideon  intact on their way out mayfeld puts his  imperial sharpshooter skills to the test  blasting a tank of rydonium destroying  the facility  in some ways it's showing off to mando  who in chapter 6 questioned mayfeld's  shooting skills  former imperial sharpshooter that's not  saying much  i wasn't a stormtrooper wise ass and it  wouldn't be an episode of the  mandalorian without one final threat to  their escape as two tie fighters chase  after them in a throwback to attack of  the clones where  jango fett unleashes a seismic charge in  the asteroid field  boba does the same completely oblitering  the two fighters  back to safety mayfield is ready to go  back to the scrap heap but mando and  kara give him his freedom  opting to tell the authorities that  prisoner 34667  died on morak with the coordinates now  collected mando can turn his sights on  moff gideon and the child he sends a  warning message to moff which is  basically the  dialogue from taken i will find you  and i will kill you actually mando's  dialogue here is almost the exact same  dialogue used by moff gideon in season  one  you may think you have some idea what  you are in possession of  but you do not you may think you have  some idea of what you are in possession  of  but you do not the only difference here  is that moff refers to grogu as  it and mando refers to him as he really  showing how mando views him as a person  while moff views him as an  object to be owned the only question  that remains here is how  mando plans to infiltrate an entire  imperial cruiser  and retrieve moff's most prized  possession will we see moth finally use  his dark saber and will  other characters like ahsoka and bokutan  make an appearance  will kara doon use her links with the  new republic to call on additional  firepower to take out the imperials  whatever happens the season finale is  shaping up to be super epic  and if everything works out i'll be able  to cover it next week thanks for  watching everyone  please make sure to like and subscribe  and follow me on twitter and instagram  at think story yt until next time  remember  i have spoken


